OL,3,GNEWSA'I was blamed for my baby's death
OL,4,Anow NHS needs to change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Poppy Russell died shortly after
OL,7,Fbirth, her parents were left bereft.
OL,9,FWhat followed made matters harder to
OL,10,Fbear - her mother was blamed for the
OL,11,Fdeath.
OL,13,FAn inquest would later conclude that
OL,14,FPoppy's death was preventable.
OL,16,FBut instead of walking away from the
OL,17,Ftrust that had failed them, Neil and
OL,18,FKatie Russell are now working with it
OL,19,Fto bring compassionate care back into
OL,20,Fthe NHS.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
